From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sobs <antohasobne@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:10:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Player: aim assist for a gamepad, as DOOM 3 BFG's

The target: the best enemy in front within 76 m that can be seen (0.8
for looking at it, 0.2 for being near). Friction: while the line of aim
passes near it (2.4 m, 4.9 m at 19.5 m and farther), the stick's turn
(axes turn l/r, look u/d) slows to 0.4 on the target; the mouse's (view
axes) is left alone. Adhesion: while the player moves, the view turns
towards a target near the line of aim, a quarter of what is left and 0.6
degrees at most a 60 Hz frame. plr_iAimAssist (persistent, 1 by
default) turns it on or off.
